[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17884.15, "timestamp": "04:58:04", "text": "离开。我不想去。不再。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17886.788, "timestamp": "04:58:06", "text": "是的。不再。结束了。好的。那里我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17889.91, "timestamp": "04:58:09", "text": "去。其他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17894.23, "timestamp": "04:58:14", "text": "嘿，我们成功了。哦，我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17897.67, "timestamp": "04:58:17", "text": "你是怎么知道是双胞胎的？呃，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17900.23, "timestamp": "04:58:20", "text": "没有操作。没有鬼魂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17902.948, "timestamp": "04:58:22", "text": "写作。天气非常冷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17906.628, "timestamp": "04:58:26", "text": "然后是 EMF5。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17909.83, "timestamp": "04:58:29", "text": "然后它打开了开关，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17912.07, "timestamp": "04:58:32", "text": "没有留下任何指纹。所以不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17913.59, "timestamp": "04:58:33", "text": "指纹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17916.868, "timestamp": "04:58:36", "text": "啊。然后你，你，你看到了，就在那时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17918.708, "timestamp": "04:58:38", "text": "呃，游戏开始时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17922.11, "timestamp": "04:58:42", "text": "然后超级活跃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17925.43, "timestamp": "04:58:45", "text": "呃，当我们再次去的时候，真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17930.07, "timestamp": "04:58:50", "text": "安静的。是的。是的。所以就像两种不同的"}]